# fresh_dev_suspend_finish_twice_dies: rvg_device_finish_suspend twice: the first sets run state 2, so the second fails DeviceCore::finish_suspend's check that the state is EnteringSuspend (DeviceDeath::SuspendNotBegun) and the host dies there. No display page, on purpose: without the store of 2 the second call would pass the check and, with no guest display to pause twice, return a blob; with a guest display it would die at GuestDisplay::pause's own check (its PauseTwice death) instead, at the same op (fresh_dev_suspend_second_suspend_dies).
